  "description": "After eight - or has it been nine? - years of unrequited love for Seo I-Do, Gyeon-Woo has finally had enough of this endless one-sided relationship and decides to take drastic action. He secretly snaps photos of Ido cheating and uses them for blackmail. All Gyeon-Woo wants is just one night with Ido. Their night of passion went as planned, but as Gyeon-Woo turns over in bed, he finds a new guy lying beside him… As Gyeon-Woo is forced to reckon with his new reality, what shape will his love for Ido take on?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 11 extra chapters.*",
